---
manual: element.image
lines: [2006, 2009]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  para "Nice, nice, very nice.  Busy, busy, busy."
  $picture = image "assets/red-40x30.png"
end
----------- test code
assert_instance_of Shoes::Image, $picture, "image returns a Shoes::Image"
assert_same $picture, image.obj, "the returned image is the one in the window"
